WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.379 --> 00:00:03.699
You wash cars and hand them back every day.

2
00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:07.659
How many customers return? Can you follow up after the wash?

3
00:00:07.739 --> 00:00:10.619
Do you know how your day is going while you are away?

4
00:00:11.732 --> 00:00:15.052
With Muwalif, organise your car wash around WhatsApp.

5
00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:17.972
From welcoming the customer to following up on their visit.

6
00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.525
The customer scans the code and sends their request.

7
00:00:21.645 --> 00:00:24.885
Your team records the queue, service and price.

8
00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:29.165
When the car is ready, confirm readiness and record payment.

9
00:00:29.245 --> 00:00:32.285
Every completed wash becomes part of the customer record.

10
00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:35.997
Ask the customer about their experience after the service.

11
00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:38.717
Everyone can receive the invitation to review.

12
00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:41.557
Customer feedback reaches you so you can follow up.

13
00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.590
For customers who agreed to reminders,

14
00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.310
prepare a message at a time suited to their visits.

15
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.590
When they return, record their new completed wash.

16
00:00:51.703 --> 00:00:54.783
Choose a loyalty reward that suits your car wash.

17
00:00:54.903 --> 00:00:57.823
Track package visits with a clear balance.

18
00:00:58.936 --> 00:01:03.136
Your daily summary shows services and collections by payment method,

19
00:01:03.176 --> 00:01:05.336
along with expenses recorded by your team.

20
00:01:05.456 --> 00:01:08.976
Review the day on your phone, even away from the shop.

21
00:01:10.088 --> 00:01:14.048
Two additional washes a week at SAR 45 each

22
00:01:14.128 --> 00:01:17.488
would be SAR 360 over four weeks.

23
00:01:17.688 --> 00:01:19.888
Illustrative revenue before costs.

24
00:01:21.001 --> 00:01:24.561
We are selecting the first five car washes in Riyadh for a free trial.

25
00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:26.881
Fourteen days after onboarding.

26
00:01:26.961 --> 00:01:29.281
Request a Muwalif trial through the link.
